WEBVTT

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:15.120
Hey, Aki, know what's next week?
There's a fireworks festival!

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.370
Every year it's super fun.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:22.620
When the fireworks end, it really hits you
that summer's at an end, you know?

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.830
And when summer ends,
like, school starts, right?

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.540
So, like, I won't be around here much longer.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.200
Gotcha!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.120
Don't you have something to say?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
Come on. Say it!

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.250
Nana! O-Ow!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.160
Take this!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.250
I'll miss you! I'll miss you, Nana!

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.250
Video game time.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.910
"Tanamachi"

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:30.160
Thanks for helping out in this heat.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:32.620
"Open for business."

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:32.620
Oh, it's no trouble at all.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:37.200
Good afternoon.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.580
Oh, Ayaka. Good to see you.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:43.910
What'll it be today?
The seasonal items in stock are all great.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:48.540
"38th Annual Fireworks Festival"

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:48.540
Then could I get some okra?

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.200
Thanks for your business.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.200
Thank you.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.830
We're back!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.330
Oh, finally!

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:00.250
Oh, my. What is it?

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:05.000
Sis, it's been a while since
you've done you-know-what for me.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.330
Oh, all right. Then let's go to my room.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.250
Yes!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.580
Akkun, can you take care of these?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.660
Sure.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.080
What're they doing?

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.200
"Ear Cleaning, Lost, Fireworks"

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.410
That was super awesome!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:53.450
What's this? Aki, why were
you standing here?

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.160
No reason...

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.500
You heard us, didn't you?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.580
It's not polite to eavesdrop, you know.

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:03.250
N-Nana, what were you doing in there?!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.120
Ear cleaning.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.790
Have her do you, too, Aki!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.790
No, I, uh...

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:19.910
Sis will go... deep inside you...
and hit places... you can't reach.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.500
It's amazing.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.620
Wh-Wh-Wha-What?

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:27.790
OMG, your face. What a riot.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:37.700
Sis! Aki says he wants you to clean his ears.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.750
Um, I d-do--

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.910
You do? All right.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.790
Well, have fun!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:47.910
Hey, w-wait!

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:50.330
Tell me how it went later.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:55.700
Don't be so restrained.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:00.330
Just pretend it's your mom cleaning your ears.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.370
My mom?

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.250
Now, come here.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.950
You're so tense. Just relax.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:19.870
Okay. We'll start with your right ear.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:25.580
I hadn't noticed what cute ears you have.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.660
You're even stiffer than before.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.540
There was quite a bit of buildup.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.290
The finishing touch.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:06:00.080
Do you feel refreshed?
Now for the left. Turn over, please.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.120
T-Too close!

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:10.790
Sorry, but it's hard for me to see your
ear there. Could you move further down?

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.580
Oh, th-that's right.

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.660
Okay, here we go.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:23.620
I'm so close to Miss Caretaker
I can tell how nice she smells.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:25.790
It's so relaxing.

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:32.250
It's like Miss Caretaker
has enveloped my whole body.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.500
There. All finished.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:49.200
I'm pretty good at ear cleaning.
Yuzu and the others tell me it feels good.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.450
Akkun?

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:55.540
You should be about done by now.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.080
How was it?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.040
Th-Thank you!

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:13.700
Of course. Come back any time.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:22.580
I found him asleep like this. Isn't it hilarious?

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:26.500
Hey, sleepyhead.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.370
Pretty pathetic.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.830
Please don't mock me.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:35.910
You might find these two photos interesting.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:45.040
What was that about how I looked?

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:52.040
Aki, check me out!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:56.540
Tada! Whaddaya think?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.290
Why a yukata?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:03.160
I mentioned it the other day.
Today's the fireworks festival!

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:08.620
Or do you just want to shoot
fireworks with me in private?

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.660
I don't quite get it.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.790
Me, neither!

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.830
Oh, my. You're hanging over your <i>obi</i> .

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:21.000
Nana, are you wearing your
normal undergarments under your yukata?

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.450
Yeah, like, the special bras are ugly.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:30.700
Regardless, traditional clothing looks
better with a sleek silhouette.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.910
Then I'll just wear no bra.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:39.330
Wait, I've never even seen you
in traditional clothes. That's not fair.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.750
That's because, well,
I can't find the right size.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:48.540
Well, a regular store might not have it,
but there must be something online.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:55.790
Oh, right. You don't know how
to work computers or smart phones.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:59.620
I-It's fine. I just won't go in a yukata.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.790
Akkun?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.540
Oh, I... just thought it's too bad...

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.540
Then maybe I'll wear one after all.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:12.870
Akkun, Could you help me wrap my <i>sarashi</i> ?

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.250
Do mine, too!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.250
Aki.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:17.700
Akkun.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.910
Y-You'll have to help each other with that!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.200
We're doing this because we have to. Got me?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.870
Yes, yes.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:33.120
It's our duty as his seniors.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:35.660
Yes, very noble of you, President.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:40.500
I don't have any reason to invite Shiina.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.700
I'm just being friendly
since we live under one roof.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.950
Just be honest with yourself.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.830
Shall I do it, then?

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.580
No, uh... I've got it.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.580
We'll start with the <i>sarashi</i> .

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.580
Come on, Aki.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.580
Shiina, are you here? I wanted to--

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.870
Yes?

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.540
Like I care, idiot!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.120
What was that about?!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.580
So this is a Tokyo fireworks festival.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:34.410
I'll hold your widdle hand
so we don't get separated!

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:40.370
Akkun, you've never been to this area before,
right? We can't have you getting lost.

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:45.620
This is a pretty rare experience,
to have a woman on each arm.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:52.290
Feels more like I'm an alien in custody.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:57.200
Ayaka, we're going to check out
the stalls over there.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.540
Oh, then I-I'll join y--

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:05.120
Reminds me of us last year.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:07.870
Well, it should be a good experience for you.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:10.750
Good luck now.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.830
What?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.040
Okay, here we go!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.290
I, um, I-I'll be fine now.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.870
Oh, my. You will?

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:32.500
Don't blame me if you get lost.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.660
I-I won't get lost!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.370
Really?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.660
Ooh! Aki, let's do that one!

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.500
"Grand Prize"

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.580
Hit! You're good at this.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:51.120
How was that?

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.000
Incredible! Let me try.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:12:00.250
Oh, no. That's all wrong.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:05.540
Aki, you're small, so you need to use
your body and elbows to steady the gun.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.950
You're right. It's stable now.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.660
I know, right?

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.450
Man, that was super awesome.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:28.200
Hey! How come you're
holding my hand again?

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.830
I just won that match, didn't I?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.370
I didn't agree to that!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.120
You didn't?

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.830
Hey, Aki. Let's do that one next!

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.620
I couldn't even get one.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.870
Amazing!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:59.660
What? Aki, finished already?
Isn't that premature?

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:07.620
"Goldfish Scooping"

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:04.950
Okay, let's go. You can keep these, mister.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:07.620
What? You don't want your goldfish?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:11.790
Even if I take them with me,
I can't take care of them.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.120
Um--

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.620
Hey, it's that boy!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.250
Nana located.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:19.160
Mai! Uchifuji!

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:23.450
Hey, kiddo, want some of my syrup?

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:27.830
Your hair is so soft and fluffy.
It's like cotton candy!

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:31.450
Hey!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.200
You guys never let up.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.410
Sorry!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.040
Don't be so mad.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:43.660
We took the opportunity to admire
pretty boys in yukatas, but it's all couples!

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:48.290
We just wanted to nourish our hearts
with the pretty boy we finally found--

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.450
Welcome! Welcome!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:14:03.950
"Yatsuho Liquor"

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:51.830
Oh.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:55.080
Oh, Ayaka. Step on up.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:56.790
G-Good evening.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.410
Oh, having a girls' night?

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:02.200
I'm a guy!

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.950
A very popular one.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:08.370
"Menu 500 yen apiece"

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:08.370
Have something to eat.
We have all sorts of stuff.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:12.200
The food cart staple: baked potato...

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.540
...with squid <i>shiokara</i> .

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:22.330
Edamame, roasted tofu, roasted squid.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.700
It's all bar snacks.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:28.700
And for you, Ayaka, I also have beer.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:33.290
I'm sorry. I'm on guardian duty today.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.950
He sure has a lot of guardians!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.540
Akkun, open wide.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.040
Have a bite.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.750
O-Okay.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.540
Hey, hey, Aki. Have some
of this, too. Open wide.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:07.080
Here, kiddo. An ice-cold snow cone.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.370
Let's play the squid tentacle game.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.750
Have some <i>takoyaki</i> , too.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.700
Have some cotton candy.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:20.790
I-I can't take any more!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.910
Akkun!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.910
Aki!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.540
Did we tease him too much?

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.620
You fooled around too much, Uchifuji.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:39.910
"Ring toss"

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.040
Here you go.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.870
So cute.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.910
I wonder how Shiina
and the others are doing.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.700
Who cares about him?

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.250
"Stupid Shiina"

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:46.790
"Ring Toss"

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:05.500
Where am I now?

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:13.830
What? Shiina's lost?!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:20.580
It seems we got separated.
We split up to search for him.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.790
What is that idiot doing?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:28.830
Don't worry about it,
but let us know if you see him.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:29.950
Bye.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.290
I went pretty far, didn't I?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.040
I better get back.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:52.080
The fireworks.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:04.120
I really did want to see this with everyone.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.500
What's my problem?

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:19.330
Found you.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.950
M-Miss Caretaker!

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.290
That was a no-no.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:32.500
Um, I... I-I'm sorry...

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:37.700
You still need me to take care of you.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:10.410
Everyone was worried about you.
Shall we head back?

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:12.120
Y-Yes.

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:17.790
This way you can't run away from me again.

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:39.540
Could it be that all this set a good mood?

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.660
Lost child announcem-- Hey!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:54.790
Shiina! Quit putzing around
and get back here!

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:56.500
P-President?!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.500
We'd better hurry.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.790
Yes.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.660
Aki, this is it!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.080
It's over.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:50.580
The fireworks festival is now closing.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:54.120
Please watch your step as you leave.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:59.290
Also, please remember
not to leave your garbage.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.000
Hey, that's the part where you jump!

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:13.290
Oh, you still suck at this.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.120
Want me to take over?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.790
L-Let me try again.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.000
Why are you so serious?

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:29.290
Hey, Aki. Let's play games again some time.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:35.410
You have to get good
by the next time I see you.

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:42.160
Do you have everything?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:45.830
Shall I accompany you to the station after all?

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:49.410
Sis, you're acting like my mom again!

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:55.160
It was a short time, but I enjoyed it.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:59.830
You guys made this
summer break super special.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.660
Okay, then. Bye-bye.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.870
Nana!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:20.200
I-I... Um... B-By the next time we meet,
I swear I'll get good!

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:24.830
Okay!

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:05.080
I'm back!

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:07.700
N-Nana?!

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:12.250
Like, it's Sunday, so there's
no school and I'm bored.

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:16.200
Is Sis here? I'm kinda hungry.

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:19.580
What was with the whole
heartfelt goodbye routine before?!

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:23.120
What I do on the weekend is my business.

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:30.750
So I'll be dropping by every so often.
We'll have so much fun!

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:42.000
"Roasted Sweet Potato, Nursing, Mascot"
